d="438" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nos5MpiJUTpQv6/GCJYxI4Sm1Ew=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">nos5MpiJUTpQv6/GCJYxI4Sm1Ew=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-526167530</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="167"/><sdl:cxt id="38"/><sdl:cxt id="39"/><sdl:cxt id="40"/><sdl:node id="100"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a8fafb7a-03ad-4ec0-9bab-49869ea7c811"><source><g id="6675">mirasi</g>       дж. <g id="6690">mirasiryt</g>, тат. <g id="6705">mirasund</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="439"><g id="6675">mirasi</g>       дж. <g id="6690">mirasiryt</g>, тат. <g id="6705">mirasund</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="439">mirasi       Juh. mirasiryt, Tat. mirasund</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="439" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2SBnBWZAEujeCWqeUAO8JBHCWnk=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2SBnBWZAEujeCWqeUAO8JBHCWnk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">411698712</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="168"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a821bc3e-ccdc-4760-9ed2-fbfedc3e8d14"><source>Табл. 4. Синтетические формы, образуемые от основы II, на примере глагола ‘достигать’</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="440">Табл.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="441">4.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="442">Синтетические формы, образуемые от основы II, на примере глагола ‘достигать’</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="440">Table</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="441">4.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="442">Synthetic forms formed from Stem II, using the example of the verb ‘to reach’</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="440" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:rep id="Wii3iR2j5y4NuMCHg2qG75EQdtM="/><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:rep id="Wii3iR2j5y4NuMCHg2qG75EQdtM="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Wii3iR2j5y4NuMCHg2qG75EQdtM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Wii3iR2j5y4NuMCHg2qG75EQdtM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">583126357</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="441" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-631598461</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="442" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">H/TGWm80hCr485CcrGC+XqOQ0GQ=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">H/TGWm80hCr485CcrGC+XqOQ0GQ=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1843875754</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="169"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5b38f6ee-113f-4764-bbc3-cd95dbe54f3a"><source>Кроме этих двух синтетических форм, от основы II образуется большое количество аналитических и бывших аналитических форм. Они восходят к комбинации отглагольных имен (инфинитива, причастия, герундива) с формами связки, с формами глагола ‘быть’ от основ <g id="6768">bir</g>-, <g id="6777">boş</g>-, <g id="6783">bisd</g>- и с другими формантами. Способы их образования и функции пока недостаточно хорошо описаны как для татского языка, так и для джуури, поэтому детальное их сопоставление остается делом будущего. Я рассмотрю здесь только три формы с основой II, о которых точно можно сказать, что они различаются в татском и джуури.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="443">Кроме этих двух синтетических форм, от основы II образуется большое количество аналитических и бывших аналитических форм.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="444">Они восходят к комбинации отглагольных имен (инфинитива, причастия, герундива) с формами связки, с формами глагола ‘быть’ от основ <g id="6768">bir</g>-, <g id="6777">boş</g>-, <g id="6783">bisd</g>- и с другими формантами.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="445">Способы их образования и функции пока недостаточно хорошо описаны как для татского языка, так и для джуури, поэтому детальное их сопоставление остается делом будущего.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="446">Я рассмотрю здесь только три формы с основой II, о которых точно можно сказать, что они различаются в татском и джуури.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="443">In addition to these two synthetic forms, a large number of analytical and former analytical forms are formed from Stem II.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="444">They trace back to a combination of verbal nouns (infinitive, participle, gerundive) with copula forms, with forms of the verb ‘to be’ from the stems bir-, boş-, bisd-, and with other formants.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="445">The methods of their formation and their functions are not yet sufficiently well described for either Tat or Juhuri, so their detailed comparison remains a matter for the future.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="446">Here I will consider only three forms with Stem II that can be definitely said to differ in Tat and Juhuri.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="443" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GHAFh6+0K5k8HTBHaBZCa/9DLtw=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GHAFh6+0K5k8HTBHaBZCa/9DLtw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">551111370</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="444" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yZxqhGZ7fy+u12dX82ehL73ZXcM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yZxqhGZ7fy+u12dX82ehL73ZXcM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-454204512</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="445" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">/Ji1QkafFnkDCy8/mDT31+y9QYU=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">/Ji1QkafFnkDCy8/mDT31+y9QYU=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">396621577</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="446" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">g0pnDYNQ47JJf3Jgc+rHAl5KrJk=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">g0pnDYNQ47JJf3Jgc+rHAl5KrJk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-389824719</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="170"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="106cf4c6-630c-4789-b7b7-f76d446aa7c7"><source>Форма, восходящая к аналитической форме герундив + связка: </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="447">Форма, восходящая к аналитической форме герундив + связка:</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="447">The form, tracing back to the analytical form gerundive + copula:</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="447" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">o0NvUzNrlKJdVP1g7lDhmul4r5I=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">o0NvUzNrlKJdVP1g7lDhmul4r5I=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1512645718</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="171"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="08f762f8-a7c4-4e9d-9ac1-b4a5bf2f5285"><source>Sg. 1. <g id="6834">rasirən-ym</g>  2. дж. <g id="6861">rasirən-i</g>,<g id="6873"> </g>тат. <g id="6882">rasirəniji</g> 3. <g id="6897">rasirən-i</g><g id="6897"> </g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="448">Sg.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="449">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="450"><g id="6834">rasirən-ym</g>  2. дж. <g id="6861">rasirən-i</g>,<g id="6873"> </g>тат. <g id="6882">rasirəniji</g> 3. <g id="6897">rasirən-i</g></mrk><g id="6897"> </g></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="448">Sg.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="449">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="450">rasirən-ym  2. дж. rasirən-i, тат. rasirəniji 3. rasirən-i</mrk><g id="6897"> </g></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="448" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="9hAAU/N7DpxXGah+qJcadpRoweo="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9hAAU/N7DpxXGah+qJcadpRoweo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1848857777</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="449" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1057708863</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="450" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZueK4yGCnpHIqdgzXY8fV8zp7EA=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZueK4yGCnpHIqdgzXY8fV8zp7EA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2095906726</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="172"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="269f311a-c3d9-4400-af48-a00bb1444fd9"><source>Pl.  1. <g id="6921">rasirənim</g> 2. дж. <g id="6951">rasirənit</g>, тат. <g id="6969">rasirənind</g> 3. дж. <g id="6990">rasirənyt</g>, тат. <g id="7008">rasirənund</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="451">Pl.</mrk>  <mrk mtype="seg" mid="452">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="453"><g id="6921">rasirənim</g> 2. дж. <g id="6951">rasirənit</g>, тат. <g id="6969">rasirənind</g> 3. дж. <g id="6990">rasirənyt</g>, тат. <g id="7008">rasirənund</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="451">Pl.</mrk>  <mrk mtype="seg" mid="452">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="453">rasirənim 2. дж. rasirənit, тат. rasirənind 3. дж. rasirənyt, тат. rasirənund</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="451" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="NrEP6I0Bn8t/nV/fuoI8r+GBXuY="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NrEP6I0Bn8t/nV/fuoI8r+GBXuY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1849185460</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="452" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1057708863</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="453" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yWPYpQIFXn9JB+c//VPN0BMYaOQ=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yWPYpQIFXn9JB+c//VPN0BMYaOQ=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1061980824</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="173"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="ee7925a5-d704-4247-9153-8341ae0ca164"><source>В татском эта форма имеет значение будущего категорического (Грюнберг 1963: 71). В джуури это форма настоящего времени, выражающая видовое значение, близкое к хабитуальному, и противопоставленная другой форме настоящего времени, образуемой с формантом <g id="7029">ədə</g>-, со значением прогрессива: </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="454">В татском эта форма имеет значение будущего категорического (Грюнберг 1963:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="455">71).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="456">В джуури это форма настоящего времени, выражающая видовое значение, близкое к хабитуальному, и противопоставленная другой форме настоящего времени, образуемой с формантом <g id="7029">ədə</g>-, со значением прогрессива:</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="454">In Tatar this form has the meaning of categorical future (Grünberg 1963:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="455">71).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="456">In Juur this is a present tense form expressing an aspectual meaning close to habitual, and opposed to another present tense form formed with the formative ədə-, with a progressive meaning:</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="454" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">w0lO7+KEVzzyfNyzPzIRsKhV8XA=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">w0lO7+KEVzzyfNyzPzIRsKhV8XA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">719108966</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="455" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="Jew_study_RU_EnUK" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="MXAHRxiF+It6HYw3JouPkebr7Fg="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MXAHRxiF+It6HYw3JouPkebr7Fg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-337077210</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="456" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KQbklHpYmjCPyCDY+jA+MdPFf+c=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KQbklHpYmjCPyCDY+jA+MdPFf+c=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1695146042</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="174"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="439c9909-f58c-4cc2-b219-e2211b91973e"><source>Sg. 1. <g id="7044">ədəm rasirə </g>2. <g id="7059">ədəj rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7071">ədəj rasirə</g><g id="7071"> </g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="457">Sg.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="458">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="459"><g id="7044">ədəm rasirə </g>2. <g id="7059">ədəj rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7071">ədəj rasirə</g></mrk><g id="7071"> </g></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="457">Sg.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="458">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="459">ədəm rasirə 2. ədəj rasirə  3. ədəj rasirə</mrk><g id="7071"> </g></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="457" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="9hAAU/N7DpxXGah+qJcadpRoweo="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9hAAU/N7DpxXGah+qJcadpRoweo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1848857777</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="458" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-631598461</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="459" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9R09TtmXCVEraRIjSmWK6qg6G9w=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">391054558</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="175"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="efe7d961-3a70-4858-9319-29a644ad7225"><source>Pl.  1. <g id="7083">ədəjm rasirə </g>2. <g id="7098">ədəjt rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7110">ədət rasirə</g><g id="7110"> </g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="460">Pl.</mrk>  <mrk mtype="seg" mid="461">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="462"><g id="7083">ədəjm rasirə </g>2. <g id="7098">ədəjt rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7110">ədət rasirə</g></mrk><g id="7110"> </g></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="460">Pl.</mrk>  <mrk mtype="seg" mid="461">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="462">ədəjm rasirə 2. ədəjt rasirə  3. ədət rasirə</mrk><g id="7110"> </g></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="460" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="NrEP6I0Bn8t/nV/fuoI8r+GBXuY="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NrEP6I0Bn8t/nV/fuoI8r+GBXuY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1849185460</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="461" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-631598461</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="462" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0aSmh2KluM9C12Pfw4jQA4H3tVM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">558575060</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="176"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="fa7472bf-93e9-4e62-aaa6-4d8460444d0c"><source>Примеры: <g id="7122">U ədəj xisirə</g> ‘Он спит (сейчас)’, <g id="7149">U ə i utoq xisirəni</g> ‘Он спит в этой комнате (всегда, как правило)’. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="463">Примеры:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="464"><g id="7122">U ədəj xisirə</g> ‘Он спит (сейчас)’, <g id="7149">U ə i utoq xisirəni</g> ‘Он спит в этой комнате (всегда, как правило)’.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="463">Examples:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="464">U ədəj xisirə ‘He is sleeping (now)’, U ə i utoq xisirəni ‘He sleeps in this room (always, as a rule)’.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="463" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="ЛюбаяTM: Biblio_RU_EnUS" percent="91"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">igpSHI2pOez9FtD7B5rhdt8Qcu8=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-347366923</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="464" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">VB0i2YiXgcToLKxS1cbo1Xg9euM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">VB0i2YiXgcToLKxS1cbo1Xg9euM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">707758570</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="177"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0499b113-5530-427b-9f0c-e4105fd114e1"><source>С формантом <g id="7167">ədə</g>- образуется и прогрессив в прошедшем: </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="465">С формантом <g id="7167">ədə</g>- образуется и прогрессив в прошедшем:</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="465">With the formative ədə- a past progressive is also formed:</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="465" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bKx/dmiT23j4wb2v3qXeL6bJQF8=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">bKx/dmiT23j4wb2v3qXeL6bJQF8=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">184920569</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="178"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="23e7578d-9d18-4348-90a2-d8c4cb83bf67"><source>Sg. 1. <g id="7185">ədəmbirym rasirə </g>2. <g id="7203">ədəmbiri rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7224">ədəmbu rasirə</g><g id="7224"> </g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="466">Sg.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="467">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="468"><g id="7185">ədəmbirym rasirə </g>2. <g id="7203">ədəmbiri rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7224">ədəmbu rasirə</g></mrk><g id="7224"> </g></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="466">Sg.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="467">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="468">ədəmbirym rasirə 2. ədəmbiri rasirə  3. ədəmbu rasirə</mrk><g id="7224"> </g></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="466" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="9hAAU/N7DpxXGah+qJcadpRoweo="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">9hAAU/N7DpxXGah+qJcadpRoweo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1848857777</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="467" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-631598461</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="468" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">dOJHXVwh6JSuFHD3JFnE/n/PZl4=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">431559152</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="179"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6b38b09c-9d63-49ed-b654-29a8e57863ee"><source>Pl.  1. <g id="7242">ədəmbirim rasirə </g>2. <g id="7260">ədəmbirit rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7281">ədəmbiryt rasirə</g><g id="7281"> </g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="469">Pl.</mrk>  <mrk mtype="seg" mid="470">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="471"><g id="7242">ədəmbirim rasirə </g>2. <g id="7260">ədəmbirit rasirə </g> 3. <g id="7281">ədəmbiryt rasirə</g></mrk><g id="7281"> </g></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="469">Pl.</mrk>  <mrk mtype="seg" mid="470">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="471">ədəmbirim rasirə 2. ədəmbirit rasirə  3. ədəmbiryt rasirə</mrk><g id="7281"> </g></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="469" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="NrEP6I0Bn8t/nV/fuoI8r+GBXuY="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NrEP6I0Bn8t/nV/fuoI8r+GBXuY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1849185460</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="470" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">kvDb2IoakeVV5COiU7UJZ5iVYjA=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:08</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-631598461</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="471" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KiNO33yPoJu+f/Peaf/6tZKVVig=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-707214138</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="180"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2cf0d610-b4a0-4167-a69b-04cbeb7ec61f"><source>В татском языке формы с <g id="7299">ədə</g>- отсутствуют, но возможно, какие-то из аналитических или бывших аналитических форм тоже выражают значение прогрессива. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="472">В татском языке формы с <g id="7299">ədə</g>- отсутствуют, но возможно, какие-то из аналитических или бывших аналитических форм тоже выражают значение прогрессива.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="472">In the Tatar language, forms with ədə- are absent, but it is possible that some analytical or former analytical forms also express the progressive meaning.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="472" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MALbP1VgjD2xe3RFV+XR0JwM2DM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">MALbP1VgjD2xe3RFV+XR0JwM2DM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1870545772</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="181"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5ee6925f-b435-4c6a-9d8f-42d56a27aac2"><source>Пассивный залог в обоих языках образуется аналитически: дж. инфинитив + глагол <g id="7311">omorə</g>, тат. инфинитив + глагол <g id="7323">birən</g>. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="473">Пассивный залог в обоих языках образуется аналитически: дж. инфинитив + глагол <g id="7311">omorə</g>, тат. инфинитив + глагол <g id="7323">birən</g>.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="473">The passive voice in both languages is formed analytically: дж. infinitive + the verb omorə, тат. infinitive + the verb birən.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="473" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BsJ6A/0T5Bf1FQrwoKUoIqn4ycg=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BsJ6A/0T5Bf1FQrwoKUoIqn4ycg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1357511898</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="182"/><sdl:cxt id="14"/><sdl:node id="101"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2489b717-9c43-4bda-9dae-9853d812633f"><source>Лексика</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="474">Лексика</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="474">Lexicon</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="474" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ttKJ8PtQCzowLIQpSln/4I9mNUo=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ttKJ8PtQCzowLIQpSln/4I9mNUo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1221235819</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="183"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e3bad934-36c5-43fe-a01a-e7470619a0dd"><source>Основной массив татской лексики и лексики джуури имеет общее происхождение. Он состоит из нескольких пластов: </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="475">Основной массив татской лексики и лексики джуури имеет общее происхождение.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="476">Он состоит из нескольких пластов:</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="475">The core body of Tatar lexicon and Juuuri lexicon has a common origin.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="476">It consists of several layers:</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="475" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wMHyp1+dtMhsqA54w/RSJScuhXU=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wMHyp1+dtMhsqA54w/RSJScuhXU=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1791271966</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="476" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">e0lPhNbZoLoeByUYRFTRDs1k9fc=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">e0lPhNbZoLoeByUYRFTRDs1k9fc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1342138261</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="184"/><sdl:cxt id="112"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="0043ba60-b847-4b0c-a1e7-1da94d191e71"><source>исконные слова иранского происхождения, </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="477">исконные слова иранского происхождения,</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="477">native words of Iranian origin,</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="477" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">iGQXeORp3Gl5OrLAsEif9Kvkt4w=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">iGQXeORp3Gl5OrLAsEif9Kvkt4w=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1054881799</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="185"/><sdl:cxt id="112"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="a9df6b70-03f0-49aa-9094-a7fea5c190c8"><source>тюркизмы – результат воздействия азербайджанского языка и, в меньшей степени, других тюркских  языков Кавказа,</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="478">тюркизмы – результат воздействия азербайджанского языка и, в меньшей степени, других тюркских  языков Кавказа,</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="478">Turkicisms – the result of influence from the Azerbaijani language and, to a lesser extent, other Turkic languages of the Caucasus,</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="478" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YM8HEf2hBkzL6wjAwvsCF0mh1H4=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YM8HEf2hBkzL6wjAwvsCF0mh1H4=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1053689332</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="186"/><sdl:cxt id="112"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="12619a17-8816-4482-8b51-b34109225466"><source>арабизмы, воспринятые не из арабского языка непосредственно, а через другие языки мусульманских народов – азербайджанский, другие тюркские и персидский языки, </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="479">арабизмы, воспринятые не из арабского языка непосредственно, а через другие языки мусульманских народов – азербайджанский, другие тюркские и персидский языки,</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="479">Arabisms, taken not directly from the Arabic language but through other languages of Muslim peoples – Azerbaijani, other Turkic, and Persian languages,</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="479" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aaRWPJz5vAa467KrhS86X3W/KyI=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">aaRWPJz5vAa467KrhS86X3W/KyI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1729004485</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="187"/><sdl:cxt id="112"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="08ef8ea9-1ab2-4c19-82cf-66d39ad0c6cb"><source>заимствования из русского языка, которые относятся к трем периодам: имперскому, советскому и постсоветскому. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="480">заимствования из русского языка, которые относятся к трем периодам: имперскому, советскому и постсоветскому.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="480">borrowings from Russian that belong to three periods: Imperial, Soviet, and post‑Soviet.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="480" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">K3Wyldq4iMwOfWFLleDBI9a9lZo=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">K3Wyldq4iMwOfWFLleDBI9a9lZo=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2091293567</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="188"/><sdl:cxt id="112"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2574810e-f0c5-4af3-b05c-64eaebe96a17"><source>В джуури есть еще один лексический пласт – гебраизмы (слова из древнееврейского языка, включая слова арамейского происхождения). В татской лексике этот пласт, разумеется, отсутствует. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="481">В джуури есть еще один лексический пласт – гебраизмы (слова из древнееврейского языка, включая слова арамейского происхождения).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="482">В татской лексике этот пласт, разумеется, отсутствует.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="481">In Juuuri there is another lexical layer – Hebraisms (words from ancient Hebrew, including words of Aramaic origin).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="482">In the Tatar lexicon this layer, of course, is absent.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="481" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ybWogJ2c9GidyhMdVVIy5XjJiUY=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ybWogJ2c9GidyhMdVVIy5XjJiUY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-375705087</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="482" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BCxAhz62BH/dlBZSovOnzIM6OhY=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">BCxAhz62BH/dlBZSovOnzIM6OhY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">2106200984</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="189"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3bdfbd3e-ad16-45ee-b4dd-b48c734f3f41"><source>В рамках данной статьи я хочу уделить внимание прежде всего гебраизмам в джуури и их соответствиям в татском. Но лексические различия между джуури и татским языком не сводятся к наличию/отсутствию гебраизмов. Например, татским тюркизмам <g id="7341">г’iмiш</g> ‘серебро’ и <g id="7374">гзыл</g> ‘золото’ (из тюрк. <g id="7392">qizil</g> ‘красный’) соответствуют в джуури слова иранского происхождения <g id="7407">nyqrə</g> ‘серебро’ (перс. <g id="7428">noqre</g>) и <g id="7437">syrxi</g> ‘золото’ (перс. <g id="7455">sorkh</g> ‘красный’). Исконные слова в обоих языках восходят иногда к разным иранским корням: джуури <g id="7494">dədə</g> ‘мать’ и <g id="7512">bəbə</g> ‘отец’, татск. <g id="7539">мö</g> ‘мать’ (перс. <g id="7560">mādar</g>) и <g id="7575">пijäр</g> ‘отец’ (перс. <g id="7605">pedar</g>), или слова одинакового происхождения получают разное морфологическое или фонетическое оформление (дж. <g id="7626">şumordə</g> и татск. <g id="7629">бiшмардан</g> ‘считать’ – перс. <g id="7632">šomordan</g>, дж. <g id="7638">birəħnə</g> и татск. <g id="7647">б</g>υ<g id="7653">нähрä</g> ‘голый’ –  перс. <g id="7665">berahne</g>). </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="483">В рамках данной статьи я хочу уделить внимание прежде всего гебраизмам в джуури и их соответствиям в татском.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="484">Но лексические различия между джуури и татским языком не сводятся к наличию/отсутствию гебраизмов.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="485">Например, татским тюркизмам <g id="7341">г’iмiш</g> ‘серебро’ и <g id="7374">гзыл</g> ‘золото’ (из тюрк. <g id="7392">qizil</g> ‘красный’) соответствуют в джуури слова иранского происхождения <g id="7407">nyqrə</g> ‘серебро’ (перс. <g id="7428">noqre</g>) и <g id="7437">syrxi</g> ‘золото’ (перс. <g id="7455">sorkh</g> ‘красный’).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="486">Исконные слова в обоих языках восходят иногда к разным иранским корням: джуури <g id="7494">dədə</g> ‘мать’ и <g id="7512">bəbə</g> ‘отец’, татск. <g id="7539">мö</g> ‘мать’ (перс. <g id="7560">mādar</g>) и <g id="7575">пijäр</g> ‘отец’ (перс. <g id="7605">pedar</g>), или слова одинакового происхождения получают разное морфологическое или фонетическое оформление (дж. <g id="7626">şumordə</g> и татск. <g id="7629">бiшмардан</g> ‘считать’ – перс. <g id="7632">šomordan</g>, дж. <g id="7638">birəħnə</g> и татск. <g id="7647">б</g>υ<g id="7653">нähрä</g> ‘голый’ –  перс. <g id="7665">berahne</g>).</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="483">In this article I want to focus primarily on Hebraisms in Juuuri and their counterparts in Tatar.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="484">But the lexical differences between Juuuri and the Tatar language are not reduced to the presence/absence of Hebraisms.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="485">For example, the Tatar Turkicisms g’iмiш ‘silver’ and gzyl ‘gold’ (from Turkic qizil ‘red’) correspond in Juuuri to Iranian‑origin words nyqrə ‘silver’ (Pers. noqre) and syrxi ‘gold’ (Pers. sorkh ‘red’).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="486">Native words in both languages sometimes trace back to different Iranian roots: Juuuri dədə ‘mother’ and bəbə ‘father’, Tatar mö ‘mother’ (Pers. mādar) and pijär ‘father’ (Pers. pedar), or words of the same origin acquire different morphological or phonetic forms (J. şumordə and T. bişmardan ‘to count’ – Pers. šomordan, J. birəħnə and T. bünährä ‘naked’ – Pers. berahne).</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="483" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QBmwWZTq3TD2b/q8FUnUQ5G2MzI=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">QBmwWZTq3TD2b/q8FUnUQ5G2MzI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1633905771</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="484" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">AnlE9PZvJGvpSQMJJJwwxF1iCGg=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">AnlE9PZvJGvpSQMJJJwwxF1iCGg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1625503912</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="485" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4e9+ExR7iIjxSS3E20sp/nk+wQE=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4e9+ExR7iIjxSS3E20sp/nk+wQE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">124221367</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="486" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wX0NmRIYLDmWV1z1E4N5K0b31JE=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wX0NmRIYLDmWV1z1E4N5K0b31JE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1555432445</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="190"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6113794e-42c9-46f1-bbd2-bbc05bf54ab6"><source>В советский период источником культурных заимствований для обоих языков был русский. В постсоветский период ареал распространения обоих языков – и татского, и джуури – оказался пересечен государственной границей, разделяющей области доминирования разных государственных языков. Те татские диалекты и диалекты джуури, которые распространены на территории РФ, черпают названия новых реалий из русского языка, а диалекты, распространенные на территории Азербайджана, - из азербайджанского (ср. Hüseynova 2013: 82-83). Трудно сказать что-то более определенное о лексических изменениях обоих языков в постсоветский период, учитывая происходящий в сообществах языковой сдвиг, интенсивную миграцию носителей джуури и отсутствие данных, кроме полевых материалов. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="487">В советский период источником культурных заимствований для обоих языков был русский.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="488">В постсоветский период ареал распространения обоих языков – и татского, и джуури – оказался пересечен государственной границей, разделяющей области доминирования разных государственных языков.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="489">Те татские диалекты и диалекты джуури, которые распространены на территории РФ, черпают названия новых реалий из русского языка, а диалекты, распространенные на территории Азербайджана, - из азербайджанского (ср.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="490">Hüseynova 2013:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="491">82-83).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="492">Трудно сказать что-то более определенное о лексических изменениях обоих языков в постсоветский период, учитывая происходящий в сообществах языковой сдвиг, интенсивную миграцию носителей джуури и отсутствие данных, кроме полевых материалов.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="487">In the Soviet period, the source of cultural borrowings for both languages was Russian.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="488">In the post‑Soviet period, the distribution area of both languages – both Tatar and Juüri – turned out to be intersected by a state border that separates regions dominated by different official languages.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="489">The Tatar dialects and Juüri dialects that are spoken in the territory of the Russian Federation draw the names of new realities from Russian, while the dialects spoken in the territory of Azerbaijan take them from Azerbaijani (cf.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="490">Hüseynova 2013:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="491">82‑83).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="492">It is difficult to say anything more definitive about the lexical changes in both languages in the post‑Soviet period, given the language shift occurring in the communities, the intensive migration of Juüri speakers, and the lack of data beyond field materials.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="487" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yWXaCkc7VOgdeW4MI7kTfUn7ClM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">yWXaCkc7VOgdeW4MI7kTfUn7ClM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1318591621</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="488" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">x3lN0lEtXygN8Ro/FNNGVw0zB5c=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">x3lN0lEtXygN8Ro/FNNGVw0zB5c=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-407897505</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="489" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GhDSwhPi6dyUUvGRwdNIJboY2Vc=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">GhDSwhPi6dyUUvGRwdNIJboY2Vc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-2057043063</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="490" conf="Draft" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">6X9FxotpnuZCMe/D5q1t/9P3v+s=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1737103914</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="491" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="ЛюбаяTM: Biblio_RU_EnUS" percent="98"><sdl:rep id="UB1hfmR7dczxeP5E1Cb3nqD7VMI="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">UB1hfmR7dczxeP5E1Cb3nqD7VMI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1547625976</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="492" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YhF9hH7UNQ8YKZA761dJApj/LMU=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">YhF9hH7UNQ8YKZA761dJApj/LMU=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1791333285</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="191"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9a0f6530-c58e-43b6-bacd-12983ca85cfb"><source>Выявлением гебраизмов в джуури занималась Ф. Б. Юсуфова (Юсуфова 2009). Довольно значительный список гебраизмов приведен у М. И. Гаджиева (<g id="7680">Hacıyev</g> 2009: 91-92). У меня нет информации о том, на какие источники они опирались, поэтому из этих работ я включила в рассмотрение только те слова, которые внесены в словари Агаруновых, Изгияевой или Нафталиева (хотя бы в один из них) и имеют в них значение, близкое к древнееврейскому слову. Несколько десятков гебраизмов с этимологией и анализом некоторых процессов при адаптации их в джуури приводит Г. Н. Богданов (Богданов 2020: 116-122). Татские слова в этом разделе взяты из словарей-приложений к книгам Миллер 1901, <g id="7686">Hacıyev</g> 2009, Hüseynova 2013</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="493">Выявлением гебраизмов в джуури занималась Ф.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="494">Б. Юсуфова (Юсуфова 2009).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="495">Довольно значительный список гебраизмов приведен у М.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="496">И.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="497">Гаджиева (<g id="7680">Hacıyev</g> 2009:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="498">91-92).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="499">У меня нет информации о том, на какие источники они опирались, поэтому из этих работ я включила в рассмотрение только те слова, которые внесены в словари Агаруновых, Изгияевой или Нафталиева (хотя бы в один из них) и имеют в них значение, близкое к древнееврейскому слову.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="500">Несколько десятков гебраизмов с этимологией и анализом некоторых процессов при адаптации их в джуури приводит Г.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="501">Н.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="502">Богданов (Богданов 2020:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="503">116-122).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="504">Татские слова в этом разделе взяты из словарей-приложений к книгам Миллер 1901, <g id="7686">Hacıyev</g> 2009, Hüseynova 2013</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="493">The identification of Hebraisms in Juüri was carried out by F.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="494">B. Yusupova (Yusupova 2009).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="495">A fairly extensive list of Hebraisms is presented by M.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="496">I.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="497">Gadzhieva (Hacıyev 2009:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="498">91‑92).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="499">I have no information about which sources they relied on, so from these works I included for consideration only those words that are entered in the dictionaries of Agarunova, Izgiayeva or Naftaliev (at least in one of them) and have a meaning close to the ancient Hebrew word.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="500">G. presents several dozen Hebraisms with etymology and an analysis of some processes in their adaptation into Juüri.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="501">N.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="502">Bogdanov (Bogdanov 2020:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="503">116‑122).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="504">The Tatar words in this section are taken from the appendix dictionaries to the books Miller 1901, Hacıyev 2009, Hüseynova 2013.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="493" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tCAxrJ7yqnXVo9NzRh3g9Yo9UAw=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">tCAxrJ7yqnXVo9NzRh3g9Yo9UAw=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-272567692</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="494" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Ww427q8RDNsIDyfsVaZjiQDtABM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Ww427q8RDNsIDyfsVaZjiQDtABM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">78788666</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="495" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Kh2P/sQ2Ve0aJcSJHvoVBkMYY0o=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Kh2P/sQ2Ve0aJcSJHvoVBkMYY0o=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-733611443</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="496" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="brDMzKktFyMddflKnHjXRpm1/x0="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">brDMzKktFyMddflKnHjXRpm1/x0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1057708887</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="497" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4L7e6tnNzg7jVoUBWkX2pGiRRoM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4L7e6tnNzg7jVoUBWkX2pGiRRoM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">676380526</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="498" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="ЛюбаяTM: Biblio_RU_EnUS" percent="98"><sdl:rep id="UB1hfmR7dczxeP5E1Cb3nqD7VMI="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">UB1hfmR7dczxeP5E1Cb3nqD7VMI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">927275624</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="499" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">EfzLOUbPpYJCqQ428kqPRatU1AM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">EfzLOUbPpYJCqQ428kqPRatU1AM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1179370209</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="500" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5DwZXG5K1KaBqAo/+GHVXIaI1Hk=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">5DwZXG5K1KaBqAo/+GHVXIaI1Hk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1754573279</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="501" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="belle lettre RU_ENuk" percent="100"><sdl:rep id="0YUp0S8cgtNSmufZ6BgW4wasdcE="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0YUp0S8cgtNSmufZ6BgW4wasdcE=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1057708882</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="502" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3W1EMx3GMloWLB4s5fxzxRQWI5E=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3W1EMx3GMloWLB4s5fxzxRQWI5E=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1998655282</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="503" conf="Draft" origin="tm" origin-system="ЛюбаяTM: Biblio_RU_EnUS" percent="98"><sdl:rep id="UB1hfmR7dczxeP5E1Cb3nqD7VMI="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">UB1hfmR7dczxeP5E1Cb3nqD7VMI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1559313930</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="504" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">PaBfUNtroK9JYZm2dWJ1r5FzoVM=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">PaBfUNtroK9JYZm2dWJ1r5FzoVM=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">663632502</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="192"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f71d67c2-b624-4518-8c6b-c77a8d0dbe39"><source>Значительную часть гебраизмов составляют слова, обозначающие реалии, связанные с иудаизмом: </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="505">Значительную часть гебраизмов составляют слова, обозначающие реалии, связанные с иудаизмом:</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="505">A significant portion of the Hebraisms consists of words denoting realities associated with Judaism:</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="505" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8cCHh9qk3pkhnQp810Gnua1oEps=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">8cCHh9qk3pkhnQp810Gnua1oEps=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-933117820</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="193"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="9a363765-d652-4218-a4ca-5f2de2f70ab1"><source><g id="7689">lulov</g> ‘лулав, пальмовая ветвь – атрибут праздника Суккот’ (לולב), </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="506"><g id="7689">lulov</g> ‘лулав, пальмовая ветвь – атрибут праздника Суккот’ (לולב),</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="506">lulov ‘lulav, a palm branch – an attribute of the Sukkot holiday’ (לולב),</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="506" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">py2n8G5SB3b8HrrZhhPfZJ6oDOs=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">py2n8G5SB3b8HrrZhhPfZJ6oDOs=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1966305500</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="194"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="33a30d37-392c-4162-89e2-7a4aca69df48"><source><g id="7695">mozuzə</g> ‘мезуза – амулет у входа в дом’ (מזוזה),</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="507"><g id="7695">mozuzə</g> ‘мезуза – амулет у входа в дом’ (מזוזה),</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="507">mozuzə ‘mezuzah – an amulet at the entrance of a house’ (מזוזה),</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="507" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">B+yDsM6e944Leq1NJulXmBELhK4=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">B+yDsM6e944Leq1NJulXmBELhK4=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1981935446</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="195"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="77c264c0-f007-44a8-b897-29ebc5c43828"><source><g id="7722">sisid</g> ‘талит – молитвенное покрывало’ (<g id="7737">ציצת</g> ‘кисти, нашиваемые по углам талита’),</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="508"><g id="7722">sisid</g> ‘талит – молитвенное покрывало’ (<g id="7737">ציצת</g> ‘кисти, нашиваемые по углам талита’),</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="508">sisid ‘tallit – a prayer shawl’ (ציצת ‘fringes sewn on the corners of the tallit’),</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="508" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hs0/kHSbOQPO3EUKhfPGpUzcyMI=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">hs0/kHSbOQPO3EUKhfPGpUzcyMI=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1650372268</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="196"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d96b3bd8-44d3-4c9f-81f5-c9b67363555b"><source><g id="7761">ԧərəvit</g> ‘вечерняя молитва’ (<g id="7785">ערב</g> ‘вечер’) и т.д.,</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="509"><g id="7761">ԧərəvit</g> ‘вечерняя молитва’ (<g id="7785">ערב</g> ‘вечер’) и т.д.,</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="509">ԧərəvit ‘evening prayer’ (ערב ‘evening’) etc.,</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="509" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ke+QtiDiaAYlhDzHwjllW1IrsNg=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ke+QtiDiaAYlhDzHwjllW1IrsNg=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">10699158</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="197"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="2f0a772a-083d-446d-8b93-e257eed45bad"><source>а также имена собственные, названия праздников, месяцев по еврейскому календарю, священных текстов. Все это отсутствует в культуре татов-мусульман, и соответствующих слов нет в татском языке. </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="510">а также имена собственные, названия праздников, месяцев по еврейскому календарю, священных текстов.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="511">Все это отсутствует в культуре татов-мусульман, и соответствующих слов нет в татском языке.</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="510">as well as proper names, names of holidays, months of the Jewish calendar, sacred texts.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="511">All of this is absent in the culture of Tatar Muslims, and there are no corresponding words in the Tatar language.</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="510" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3R2jcNv5aJetRvfG90eLpwK2MMc=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">3R2jcNv5aJetRvfG90eLpwK2MMc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">646514511</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="511" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">O6KRqw56lOAU3TQ7BQc6xcfdAvQ=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">O6KRqw56lOAU3TQ7BQc6xcfdAvQ=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1259919793</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="198"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4dd7a25b-a3d4-4227-bbf1-d64da6aa66ef"><source>Некоторые важнейшие для иудаизма реалии и понятия в джуури обозначаются не гебраизмами, а словами другого происхождения: <g id="7833">nimaz</g> ‘синагога’ (ср.-перс. <g id="7854">namāz</g> ‘молитва, поклонение’, тат. <g id="7878">nimaz</g> ‘молитва’, <g id="7893">nimazgah</g> ‘молельня, место для молитвы’ (Hüseynova 2013: 167)), <g id="7929"><g id="7926">ħ</g>əlol</g> ‘кошерный, дозволенный’ (азерб. <g id="7950">halal</g>, тат. <g id="7959">həlal</g> ‘халяльный, дозволенный’), <g id="7977">ħərym/ħərim</g> ‘трефной, недозволенный’ (азерб. <g id="7998">hərəm</g>, тат. <g id="8007">həram/hərəm</g> то же). </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="512">Некоторые важнейшие для иудаизма реалии и понятия в джуури обозначаются не гебраизмами, а словами другого происхождения: <g id="7833">nimaz</g> ‘синагога’ (ср.-перс. <g id="7854">namāz</g> ‘молитва, поклонение’, тат. <g id="7878">nimaz</g> ‘молитва’, <g id="7893">nimazgah</g> ‘молельня, место для молитвы’ (Hüseynova 2013:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="513">167)), <g id="7929"><g id="7926">ħ</g>əlol</g> ‘кошерный, дозволенный’ (азерб. <g id="7950">halal</g>, тат. <g id="7959">həlal</g> ‘халяльный, дозволенный’), <g id="7977">ħərym/ħərim</g> ‘трефной, недозволенный’ (азерб. <g id="7998">hərəm</g>, тат. <g id="8007">həram/hərəm</g> то же).</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="512">Some of the most important realities and concepts for Judaism in Juurí are designated not by Hebraisms but by words of other origin: nimaz ‘synagogue’ (Middle Persian namāz ‘prayer, worship’, Tatar nimaz ‘prayer’, nimazgah ‘prayer house, place for prayer’ (Hüseynova 2013:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="513">167)), ħəlol ‘kosher, permitted’ (Azerb. halal, Tatar həlal ‘halal, permitted’), ħərym/ħərim ‘forbidden, prohibited’ (Azerb. hərəm, Tatar həram/hərəm same).</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="512" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">PYUtBQ/kn6s3WIFN+NLQ+Zgoih0=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">PYUtBQ/kn6s3WIFN+NLQ+Zgoih0=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1030783688</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="513" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ACiIjr83AbO+SxH4g8Trhx57YyY=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ACiIjr83AbO+SxH4g8Trhx57YyY=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">381695301</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="199"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5f32b9da-b898-4b85-aeee-8f5eab1d802b"><source>Для некоторых понятий, связанных в джуури с иудаизмом, но имеющих более универсальное значение, существуют пары синонимов, один из которых древнееврейского происхождения, а второй этимологически совпадает с татским: ‘молитва’ <g id="8037">təfilo</g> (חפילה) и <g id="8049">duvo</g> (азерб. <g id="8058">dua</g>, татск. <g id="8067">düo</g>), ‘траур’ <g id="8088">ovil</g> (אבל) и <g id="8103">jos</g> (азерб. <g id="8112">jas</g>, тат. <g id="8118">joc</g>). </source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="514">Для некоторых понятий, связанных в джуури с иудаизмом, но имеющих более универсальное значение, существуют пары синонимов, один из которых древнееврейского происхождения, а второй этимологически совпадает с татским:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="515">‘молитва’ <g id="8037">təfilo</g> (חפילה) и <g id="8049">duvo</g> (азерб. <g id="8058">dua</g>, татск. <g id="8067">düo</g>), ‘траур’ <g id="8088">ovil</g> (אבל) и <g id="8103">jos</g> (азерб. <g id="8112">jas</g>, тат. <g id="8118">joc</g>).</mrk> </seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="514">For some concepts linked in Juurí to Judaism but having a more universal meaning, there are pairs of synonyms, one of which is of ancient Hebrew origin, and the other etymologically coincides with Tatar:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="515">‘prayer’ təfilo (חפילה) and duvo (Azerb. dua, Tatar düo), ‘mourning’ ovil (אבל) and jos (Azerb. jas, Tatar joc).</mrk> </target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="514" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KhSl5DnFWCC4O3tDF0mpm989jpc=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">KhSl5DnFWCC4O3tDF0mpm989jpc=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">1698909815</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="515" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lNYZgYHIUkz1JDt1LLc2UfgPcus=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lNYZgYHIUkz1JDt1LLc2UfgPcus=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1666116287</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="200"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="4bdeddd9-a93c-42c2-aaa2-570065e9dd12"><source>Гебраизмам джуури соответствуют иранизмы или тюркизмы в татском:</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="516">Гебраизмам джуури соответствуют иранизмы или тюркизмы в татском:</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="516">Hebraisms in Juurí correspond to Iranisms or Turkisms in Tatar:</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="516" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZRi3bzEZ20q69Rn2Zhi3x1+yCn4=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZRi3bzEZ20q69Rn2Zhi3x1+yCn4=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">632120627</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="201"/><sdl:cxt id="38"/><sdl:cxt id="39"/><sdl:cxt id="40"/><sdl:node id="104"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="66a099d1-2eec-48c3-a235-be89c5acf05c"><source>Джуури</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="517">Джуури</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="517">Juurí</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="517" conf="Draft" origin="interactive"><sdl:prev-origin origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mYWrH45YkuaIeRY8ENg+wujMi6U=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">mYWrH45YkuaIeRY8ENg+wujMi6U=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">09/06/2026 21:48:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">LAPTOP-VFEQ783K\stari</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">09/06/2026 21:42:09</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1243185364</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="202"/><sdl:cxt id="38"/><sdl:cxt id="39"/><sdl:cxt id="40"/><sdl:node id="105"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="f72039f4-3e75-4405-b37d-ff2a8615fc50"><source>Татский</source><seg-source><mrk 